  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "wf-fidelity",
      "x": -380,
      "y": -250,
      "w": 320,
      "text": "Wireframes — structure only.\nGreyscale on purpose: the three highlight colours are the only colour in the set, because there they carry meaning."
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-arrive",
      "x": -380,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 320,
      "text": "1 · ARRIVING\n\nVeyra provisions the tenant, so the admin never fills in company details.\n\nOne-time password → forced reset → straight into creating the room. Step 4 is skippable."
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-overview",
      "x": -380,
      "y": 830,
      "w": 320,
      "text": "2 · THE ROOM\n\nOverview answers \"what needs me next?\" — a work queue, not a scoreboard.\n\nNo totals-of-everything tiles: nobody acts on \"512 files\"."
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-work",
      "x": -380,
      "y": 1860,
      "w": 320,
      "text": "3 · WORKING\n\nDossier is one expandable tree: all five modules, folders, sub-folders, files.\n\nContent can be added at ANY node — new folder, files, or a folder with its nesting intact.\n\nThe viewer drops the app rail on purpose — reading is a focused mode."
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-people",
      "x": -380,
      "y": 2830,
      "w": 320,
      "text": "4 · PEOPLE & OVERSIGHT\n\nGroups shows access by company, which is also how side is derived.\n\nInvite asks for the company; the side follows from it."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-nav",
      "x": -380,
      "y": 3300,
      "w": 320,
      "text": "SIDEBAR\n\nWorkspace switches rooms — one person can sit in several.\n\nQ&A is in the rail but not yet designed; it's the first thing after MVP."
    }
  ],
  "launch": {
    "view": "canvas"
  }
}